    <string name="health_rationale">Health access in Bridgit\n\nBridgit reads only the steps, sleep and heart-rate source records you grant. It never writes health data. Reads require the Health Connect feature switch and the calling control agent\'s grant. Data is returned to that control agent on request; its provider may retain a copy. No health records are retained by Bridgit. Revoke permissions in Health Connect at any time.\n\nPrivacy policy: %1$s</string>
    <string name="settings_no_browser">No browser to open %1$s</string>
    <string name="settings_reset">Reset</string>
    <string name="settings_delete_all">Delete all Bridgit data</string>
    <string name="settings_delete_all_desc">Control agents, keys, log, inbox, reports, files and settings</string>
    <string name="settings_delete_all_title">Delete all Bridgit data?</string>
    <string name="settings_delete_all_confirm">Every control agent is removed and its key stops working at once. The log, inbox, bug reports, received files, wake words and every setting are deleted, and any phone setting a control agent changed for a while is put back. Email alerts are cancelled.\n\nBridgit then closes. Next time you open it, it starts like a fresh install. This can\'t be undone.\n\nAndroid also resets Bridgit\'s permissions (camera, microphone, notifications) and turns off its notification access. Usage access and Accessibility may stay on; turn them off in Android settings if you want.</string>
    <string name="settings_delete_all_action">Delete everything</string>
